Liam_DesertLab_Sign1_Text_0:
# 7 "data/maps/Liam_DesertLab/scripts.pory"
	.string "The signal is stronger here than it was\n"
	.string "on route 119. There appears to be some\l"
	.string "interference due to the proximity of\l"
	.string "Regirock, however, so we are unable to\l"
	.string "get the best reading yet...$"

Liam_DesertLab_Sign2_Text_0:
# 19 "data/maps/Liam_DesertLab/scripts.pory"
	.string "Things are really going poorly in Kanto.\n"
	.string "I think it's likely we will have to\l"
	.string "give up this hunt for Mew soon and\l"
	.string "return to help at home...$"

Liam_DesertLab_Sign3_Text_0:
# 30 "data/maps/Liam_DesertLab/scripts.pory"
	.string "Jack was complaining so much about the\n"
	.string "commute to the route 119 outpost, but\l"
	.string "he's delusional. Come trade spots with\l"
	.string "me Jack, I'm happy to trade...$"

Liam_DesertLab_Sign4_Text_0:
# 41 "data/maps/Liam_DesertLab/scripts.pory"
	.string "I'm flying to the latest outpost\n"
	.string "tomorrow. Still sandy getting in, but\l"
	.string "it can't be as bad as this place.\p"
	.string "4E\n"
	.string "21N\l"
	.string "37W\l"
	.string "4S\l"
	.string "T28$"

Liam_DesertLab_Sign5_Text_0:
# 57 "data/maps/Liam_DesertLab/scripts.pory"
	.string "The Sootopolis lab made sense to be\n"
	.string "near the Cave of Origin to study that\l"
	.string "energy, but why the hell are we here?\l"
	.string "Do we seriously think Mew wants to chill\l"
	.string "in a sandstorm or dark cave of all\l"
	.string "places? Sure we can scan for psychic\l"
	.string "energy readings, but shouldn't we be\l"
	.string "looking in the exact opposite place?$"
